# Symbol store (symbolPolicy.storePath in release/release-operations.json).
#
# This directory must exist on fresh checkouts and in CI because
# scripts/validate-release-operations.ps1 requires the symbol store path to be
# present (symbolPolicy.requiresPdbRetention = true).
#
# Retained PDBs are published here manually (publicationMode = manual-private)
# and are intentionally git-ignored; only this placeholder is tracked so the
# directory is always available to the release pipeline.
